<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4124985911738083986..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Officer Safety Uber Alles: The Coercion Cartel&#39;s Prime Directive</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>15</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7995385494422321189</id><published>2012-03-12T08:33:37.137-06:00</published><updated>2012-03-12T08:33:37.137-06:00</updated><title type='text'>For some reason, every time it said &amp;quot;Chief Be...</title><content type='html'>For some reason, every time it said &amp;quot;Chief Bergen&amp;quot; I read &amp;quot;Chief Bergen-Belsen&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7995385494422321189'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7995385494422321189'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1331562817137#c7995385494422321189' title=''/><author><name>SicSemperTyrannis</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1044370529"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 12, 2012 at 8:33 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9185347800461673745</id><published>2012-03-01T13:15:24.673-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T13:15:24.673-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Awesome intro Mr. Grigg.&#xa;Dr. Paul is coming to our...</title><content type='html'>Awesome intro Mr. Grigg.&lt;br /&gt;Dr. Paul is coming to our town of Fairbanks Alaska this Sunday, I was wondering if you would come on our local radio show this saturday and talk to us about Ron Paul.&lt;br /&gt;If so, please email me at bighorn.alaska@gmail.com&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/9185347800461673745'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/9185347800461673745'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330632924673#c9185347800461673745' title=''/><author><name>Joshua Bennett</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14314841330994831499</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='21' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_I3o9wvoulBE/TTeflIDdW-I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/KWsd-Qm9WL0/S220/gadsden.jpeg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1185623017"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 1:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8484365218424593186</id><published>2012-02-29T14:02:32.763-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-29T14:02:32.763-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Bob... That sounds like a Freudian slip does it no...</title><content type='html'>Bob... That sounds like a Freudian slip does it not?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/8484365218424593186'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/8484365218424593186'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330549352763#c8484365218424593186' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 29, 2012 at 2:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1545905093480237512</id><published>2012-02-28T17:56:58.132-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-28T17:56:58.132-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Not to mention Mark Levin refering to the Peace, F...</title><content type='html'>Not to mention Mark Levin refering to the Peace, Freedom, and Sound Money Candidate as &amp;quot;RuPaul.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/1545905093480237512'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/1545905093480237512'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330477018132#c1545905093480237512' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2012 at 5:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-301335169448578523</id><published>2012-02-28T06:40:19.193-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-28T06:40:19.193-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Long time reader, first time hearing you speak.&#xa;Th...</title><content type='html'>Long time reader, first time hearing you speak.&lt;br /&gt;Thank you and God Bless you, sir.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/301335169448578523'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/301335169448578523'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330436419193#c301335169448578523' title=''/><author><name>sofa</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-25546131"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2012 at 6:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3498509295426828615</id><published>2012-02-26T23:06:14.291-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-26T23:06:14.291-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Bank bailouts are an example of rewarding failure ...</title><content type='html'>Bank bailouts are an example of rewarding failure so the passing out of medals was no surprise. Stopping the paramilitary raids is the correct answer but it makes too much sense in an idiocracy. DARE-to keep cops off donuts. P.S. I laugh at republican hypocrisy regarding Ron Paul calling him a moonbat and his supporters Paultards. They say anyone but obama out of one side of their mouth then mock the only candidate with any morals or common sense ideas out of the other side.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/3498509295426828615'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/3498509295426828615'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330322774291#c3498509295426828615' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-420427550"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2012 at 11:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1180343466097508087</id><published>2012-02-26T22:43:31.259-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-26T22:43:31.259-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article, as always.  And I sure am jealous a...</title><content type='html'>Great article, as always.  And I sure am jealous at your chance to give a Ron Paul introduction, completely knock it out of the park, and then have the man refer to you by your first name!  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep up the great fight, Mr Grigg!  I have been reading you for over a decade now and don&amp;#39;t plan on stopping anytime soon.  It won&amp;#39;t stop us from being jealous at getting to intro Dr Paul!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/1180343466097508087'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/1180343466097508087'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330321411259#c1180343466097508087' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1604923306"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2012 at 10:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8737502304014930078</id><published>2012-02-26T08:27:03.671-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-26T08:27:03.671-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Ridding the world of dangerous people? I thought h...</title><content type='html'>Ridding the world of dangerous people? I thought his job was to bring to trial to be judged? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;China&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/8737502304014930078'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/8737502304014930078'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330270023671#c8737502304014930078' title=''/><author><name>chinasyndrome</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04085960000175006256</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_79L0zVMX7PI/S7sjVcjjHeI/AAAAAAAAACM/iu7LCBVV8Fc/S220/Chinasyndrome.bmp'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1652374753"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2012 at 8:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7947317685613938827</id><published>2012-02-25T22:45:27.991-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-25T22:45:27.991-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I saw over on Daily Paul that you had introduced D...</title><content type='html'>I saw over on Daily Paul that you had introduced Dr Paul at the Boise Rally, and so I am glad to now have the opportunity to listen in.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7947317685613938827'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7947317685613938827'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330235127991#c7947317685613938827' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1590283389"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2012 at 10:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2632066251379776944</id><published>2012-02-25T11:15:27.656-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-25T11:15:27.656-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I live in Rochester, and I personally know a lot o...</title><content type='html'>I live in Rochester, and I personally know a lot of cops that are happy this bill is finally going somewhere.  Many police are glad to see that castle doctrine, and stand-your-ground laws are passing here, just as I know many that were happy for concealed carry laws.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I am unsure of the numbers, so I cannot say for sure if they are in the minority or not.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/2632066251379776944'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/2632066251379776944'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330193727656#c2632066251379776944' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2098606548"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2012 at 11:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2951907272828306084</id><published>2012-02-25T11:04:58.364-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-25T11:04:58.364-07:00</updated><title type='text'>If a police officer really does not want to be mis...</title><content type='html'>If a police officer really does not want to be mistaken for a common criminal then he can prove it by not acting like one.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/2951907272828306084'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/2951907272828306084'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330193098364#c2951907272828306084' title=''/><author><name>parabarbarian</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04987535851654809713</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_3VbZIVsmJGM/TFtc3LpT75I/AAAAAAAAAB8/jOkEpIhGYTg/S220/III.sisyphus.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-111201508"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2012 at 11:04 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7222503254450086134</id><published>2012-02-24T10:51:57.207-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-24T10:51:57.207-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I saw the apparent ambiguity there too when I was ...</title><content type='html'>I saw the apparent ambiguity there too when I was writing that comment, but then I realized that the notion of Will Grigg being on the &lt;i&gt;receiving&lt;/i&gt; end of a beat down of any description is as self-contradictory as the notion of a rectangular triangle.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7222503254450086134'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7222503254450086134'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330105917207#c7222503254450086134' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2032177909"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2012 at 10:51 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6866721794507082916</id><published>2012-02-24T10:15:10.692-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-24T10:15:10.692-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Electric introduction.  Again I wish I&amp;#39;d been ...</title><content type='html'>Electric introduction.  Again I wish I&amp;#39;d been there but Mr. Anonymous made it appear, though unintended, that it was YOU, Will, who was getting a beat down, for whatever reason, and not that you were giving such an eloquent intro for Paul.  Sadly, well... actually not, I am not a Republican and haven&amp;#39;t been one for over ten years, but I wonder if there are open caucuses. I&amp;#39;ll need to investigate further.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/6866721794507082916'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/6866721794507082916'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330103710692#c6866721794507082916' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2012 at 10:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7470842231363571705</id><published>2012-02-24T02:30:04.039-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-24T02:30:04.039-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;A more complete and higher quality rec...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A more complete and higher quality recording of your solid gold ass kicking is available &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QyjuN27n5Qs&amp;amp;feature=related&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7470842231363571705'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4124985911738083986/comments/default/7470842231363571705'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html?showComment=1330075804039#c7470842231363571705' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/officer-safety-uber-alles-coercion.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124985911738083986' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4124985911738083986' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2032177909"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 24, 2012 at 2:30 AM"/></entry><entry><